and contributors count changed in the passed week.\n\n| Watch | Star | Fork | Contributors |\n|:-----:|:----:|:----:|:------------:|\n| 3210 | 26828 (↑199) | 15085 (↑128) | 201 (-) |\n\n### Issues & PRs\n\nIssues & PRs show the new/closed issues/pull requests count in the passed week.\n\n| New Issues | Closed Issues | New PR | Merged PR |\n|:----------:|:-------------:|:------:|:---------:|\n| 25 | 14 | 35 | 16 |\n\n## PR Overview\n\nThanks to contributions from community, Dubbo team merged **16** pull requests in the repository last week. They are:\n\n* fix for #4201 use category in url in org.apache.dubbo.registry.nacos.… ([#4204](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4204))\n* performance tuning: avoid reflection on the critical path ([#4190](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4190))\n* delete dead code ([#4189](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4189))\n* 2.7.2 release note ([#4187](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4187))\n* Remove licence from dependency ([#4186](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4186))\n* sync pull request 4138 ([#4181](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4181))\n* fix for #4175: ServiceConfigurationListener should override ProviderConfigurationListener ([#4179](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4179))\n* Solve compile problem in java11 ([#4172](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4172))\n* [Dubbo-4147] restore the metadata store key change ([#4170](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4170))\n* Add security.md ([#4165](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4165))\n* Remove incubator ([#4161](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4161))\n* [CI] Add enforce maven plugin to do snapshot version check ([#4157](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4157))\n* Compile iss ([#4155](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4155))\n* change logger name ([#4150](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4150))\n* [DUBBO-3137]: get rid of ConfigConstants, RpcConstatns, RemotingConstants ([#4138](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4138))\n* 2.7.x ([#4135](https://github.com/apache/dubbo/pull/4135))\n\n\n## Code Review Statistics\n\nDubbo encourages everyone to participant in code review, in order to improve software quality. Every week @dubbo-bot would automatically help to count pull request reviews of single github user as the following. So, try to help review code in this project.\n\n| Contributor ID | Pull Request Reviews |\n|:--------------:|:--------------------:|\n| @ralf0131 | 12 |\n| @cvictory | 7 |\n| @carryxyh | 5 |\n| @dntbeSris | 5 |\n| @chickenlj | 5 |\n| @slievrly | 5 |\n| @kexianjun | 3 |\n| @Moriadry | 3 |\n| @uglycow | 2 |\n| @CrazyHZM | 2 |\n| @Leishunyu | 1 |\n| @nzomkxia | 1 |\n| @leonliao | 1 |\n| @kezhenxu94 | 1 |\n\n\n## New Contributors\n\nWe have no new contributors in this project this week.\nDubbo team encourages everything about contribution from community.\nFor more details, please refer to https://github.com/apache/incubator-dubbo/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md .\n\n\n\n*Note: This robot is supported by [Collabobot](https://github.com/AlibabaDR/Collabobot).*","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/4221/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/dubbo/issues/4221/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]